        "detailed_description": "<h1>Deceit 2: Master Bundle</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064870/extras/0730432df6fdcac21229d660eda254cf.avif?t=1787157748\" width=748 height=896 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p><br><h1>Sobre o jogo</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064870/extras/05b68c3ab5d79f1383c77ebe6d9a7629.avif?t=1787157748\" width=780 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Deceit 2 é uma experiência de ação PVP online onde sua capacidade de confiar (e de enganar) será colocada em teste. Participe de um <strong>Ritual</strong> ancestral realizado por um <strong>Mestre do Jogo</strong> sádico, escolha a sua <strong>Função</strong> e descubra uma forma de <strong>Escapar</strong>. Você conseguirá descobrir quem está ao seu lado e quem está contra você?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064870/extras/4221d7615317100a8fe1f03668cc79ff.avif?t=1787157748\" width=780 height=118 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Três <strong>Equipes</strong> se enfrentarão frente a frente: os <strong>Inocentes</strong>, os <strong>Infectados</strong> e os <strong>Amaldiçoados</strong>. No entanto, ninguém sabe a equipe dos demais jogadores, por isso não confie em ninguém. <strong>Forme uma equipe</strong> quando precisar, minta quando não precisar e sobreviva da melhor forma que conseguir. Cada decisão impacta a forma como o pesadelo se desdobra, transformando cada <strong>Ritual</strong> em uma história única.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064870/extras/d45d8d6511f890f07361c745360848ea.poster.avif?t=1787157748\" width=780 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064870/extras/d45d8d6511f890f07361c745360848ea.webm?t=1787157748\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064870/extras/d45d8d6511f890f07361c745360848ea.mp4?t=1787157748\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064870/extras/8fe6b77abe4cb630da284f1a65b17f3c.avif?t=1787157748\" width=780 height=118 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">O <strong>Ritual</strong> é realizado em 5 locais únicos, cada um repleto de perigos e cercado por um ambiente assustador. Cada <strong>Local de Ritual </strong> oferece cenários distintos e <strong>Tarefas</strong> desafiadoras, exigindo que você utilize estratégias variadas se quiser <strong>Escapar</strong> antes de ser <strong>Banido</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064870/extras/0d1bf38160de51f2926fd2b6b75a5aa2.poster.avif?t=1787157748\" width=780 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064870/extras/0d1bf38160de51f2926fd2b6b75a5aa2.webm?t=1787157748\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064870/extras/0d1bf38160de51f2926fd2b6b75a5aa2.mp4?t=1787157748\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064870/extras/9e6a24cdef455a716f80dc6f6083879c.avif?t=1787157748\" width=780 height=118 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Nos arredores do <strong>Local de Ritual</strong>, você encontrará <strong>Tarefas</strong> que os <strong>Inocentes</strong> deverão concluir para conseguir <strong>Escapar</strong>. Ao serem concluídas, as <strong>Tarefas</strong> também desbloqueiam <strong>Itens</strong> para todo o grupo na <strong>Loja</strong>. Escolha entre ferramentas <strong>Investigativas</strong>, <strong>Ofensivas</strong> e <strong>Defensivas</strong> para multiplicar o caos, o que faz com que cada visita à <strong>Loja</strong> seja altamente impactante.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064870/extras/13e40b9fc60843113ce9b0bc31eb353e.poster.avif?t=1787157748\" width=780 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064870/extras/13e40b9fc60843113ce9b0bc31eb353e.webm?t=1787157748\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064870/extras/13e40b9fc60843113ce9b0bc31eb353e.mp4?t=1787157748\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064870/extras/5ac87898f4b63c80f5030659ab4708cc.avif?t=1787157748\" width=780 height=118 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Suba na <strong>Classificação</strong> e prove que domina o jogo competitivo. Ganhe recompensas de habilidade desbloqueando recompensas exclusivas. Alcance o topo das <strong>Tabelas de Classificação da Temporada</strong> e desafie os oponentes mais fortes para se tornar um verdadeiro <strong>Mestre do Engano</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064870/extras/7384412fc77ca5ee2ce8ac29dc2efca2.poster.avif?t=1787157748\" width=780 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064870/extras/7384412fc77ca5ee2ce8ac29dc2efca2.webm?t=1787157748\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064870/extras/7384412fc77ca5ee2ce8ac29dc2efca2.mp4?t=1787157748\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064870/extras/d6b9b865e21156f8ac232928520055c5.avif?t=1787157748\" width=780 height=118 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Participe como 1 de 9 <strong>Indivíduos</strong> presos no <strong>Ritual</strong>. Encontre o seu favorito, colete itens desbloqueáveis <strong>Subindo de Nível</strong> e personalize visuais na <strong>Coleção</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064870/extras/8904cb13696af380bc2614f6fae41c5b.poster.avif?t=1787157748\" width=780 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064870/extras/8904cb136